            "review_title": "Review at Xi-nê Bistro & Jazz",
            "review_text": "Khánh Giao\nDa Nang, Vietnam5 contributions\n0\nGood for families and couples\nJan 2026 • Family\nThe restaurant with a spacious, airy, romantic space, suitable for families or couples who want to experience European cuisine. The dishes are made carefully and quickly. The drinks here are also very delicious, especially the restaurant's signature dishes. Families can refer to this restaurant to enjoy delicious dishes. There are many photo spaces, especially the flower room. Girls can refer to it when they want to take pictures\nWritten January 28, 2026",
