            "review_title": "Review at Xi-nê Bistro & Jazz",
            "review_text": "worldtraveler1716\nVictoria, Canada241 contributions\n0\nGreat food, great staff and great restaurant\nFeb 2025 • Couples\nOn Valentine’s Day we walked in without reservation. Both the outside and inside were superbly decorated for the occasion. The manager (owner?) was non plussed about our arrival and after ordering and paying for our chosen foods and beverages we were quickly seated in an enclosed garden. \n\nWe were impressed by the speed and attentiveness of the staff. We ordered Caesar salads and both had a crab based pasta dish. While the plates and cutlery were noteworthy in themselves, the crab pasta was beautifully presented and it was superb.\n\nThe manager (owner?) came by our table a few times to check with us which was very nice and quite surprising considering the rapidly filling restaurant. He encouraged us to stay on for the jazz music, but we had plans. We’ll go back for dinner and stay for the music.\nRead more\nWritten February 15, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-04",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
